Showcase clips for the model page's "What <model> produces" section.

Each scene needs two files named after its `id` in SHOWCASE_SCENES
(src/components/model-landing-page.tsx):

  <id>.mp4   16:9, H.264 + AAC, ~6s. Keep the generated audio -- Seedance
             produces its own, and stripping it misrepresents the model.
  <id>.png   Poster frame, same aspect.

These must be real model output. The section renders nothing while the list is
empty, which is the correct state until genuine generations exist.
